  "label": "Racist stereotype: Black people are animals",
  "description": "This is a long-standing and deeply harmful racist trope that dehumanizes Black people by comparing them to animals. The meme's punchline 'the first one can't sing when you put chains on it' relies on this stereotype to imply that Black people are less than human and incapable of cultural expression under oppression. This is a form of racial degradation.",
